================================================================================
Build-time only
================================================================================

These never appear in the shipped bundle. They are listed for completeness
because they execute on a maintainer's machine.

  Vite, Tailwind CSS, TypeScript, ESLint, Vitest, @vitejs/plugin-react,
  @tailwindcss/vite, typescript-eslint, eslint-plugin-react-hooks, globals,
  @eslint/js, @types/*

  The Android build also resolves AndroidX and Android Gradle Plugin artifacts
  from Google's Maven repository (`google()`). Those are required by the Android
  toolchain and are a build-time dependency only; no artifact is fetched at
  runtime, and the release APK does not request the INTERNET permission.